---
import Diagram from '../Diagram.astro';
---
<Diagram caption="The rollback decision belongs on the runbook before the window opens. Once production writes land on Hyper-V, going back is no longer only a virtualization decision.">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 222" role="img" aria-labelledby="rbTitle rbDesc">
    <title id="rbTitle">Where rollback becomes data reconciliation during a cutover</title>
    <desc id="rbDesc">
      Five cutover steps: final backup, Instant Recovery, validate, go live, then migrate and
      protect. Through validation, rollback means stopping the recovery and powering the VMware
      VM back on. From the first production write on Hyper-V, going back is a data reconciliation
      problem that needs the application owner.
    </desc>

    <rect class="node" x="22" y="14" width="124" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="84" y="41" text-anchor="middle">Final backup</text>
    <text class="sub" x="84" y="59" text-anchor="middle">source stays off</text>
    <rect class="node" x="158" y="14" width="124" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="220" y="41" text-anchor="middle">Instant Recovery</text>
    <text class="sub" x="220" y="59" text-anchor="middle">boot on Hyper-V</text>
    <rect class="node" x="294" y="14" width="124" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="356" y="41" text-anchor="middle">Validate</text>
    <text class="sub" x="356" y="59" text-anchor="middle">real client tests</text>
    <rect class="node-edge" x="438" y="14" width="124" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="500" y="41" text-anchor="middle">Go live</text>
    <text class="sub" x="500" y="59" text-anchor="middle">new data lands</text>
    <rect class="node-edge" x="574" y="14" width="124" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="636" y="41" text-anchor="middle">Migrate + protect</text>
    <text class="sub" x="636" y="59" text-anchor="middle">storage, then backup</text>

    <path class="link" d="M146 45 L158 45" />
    <path class="link" d="M282 45 L294 45" />
    <path class="link" d="M418 45 L438 45" />
    <path class="link" d="M562 45 L574 45" />

    <!-- The boundary -->
    <path class="link-active" d="M428 8 L428 172" stroke-dasharray="6 5" />

    <rect class="node" x="22" y="100" width="396" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="220" y="127" text-anchor="middle">Rollback</text>
    <text class="sub" x="220" y="145" text-anchor="middle">stop the recovery, power the VMware VM back on</text>

    <rect class="node-edge" x="438" y="100" width="260" height="62" rx="8" />
    <text class="label" x="568" y="127" text-anchor="middle">Data reconciliation</text>
    <text class="sub" x="568" y="145" text-anchor="middle">going back needs the application owner</text>

    <text class="tag" x="428" y="194" text-anchor="middle">first production write on Hyper-V</text>
  </svg>
</Diagram>
